# RESETIUS | ADH156_A { ; Anthony Hanmer 2000
# RESETIUS |   Angle 36 ; Cesaro variation alphabet:  A
# RESETIUS |   Axiom \90ddd\90dd/180dd\90ddd\90ddd\90ddd\90d/180d\90ddd
# RESETIUS |   d=d\80d/160d\80d
# RESETIUS |   }
